    %% ── Heading & description ────────────────────────────────────
    HDR["<div style='text-align:center'><b>Smart Backlog Assistant — Extend Existing Workflow</b><br/>Traces a single requirement (REQ-001) through all 5 agent stages using<br/><b>proposed_modernization_extension.txt</b> as input and <b>existing_backlog.json</b> (BL-201) for comparison.<br/>REQ-001 matches BL-201 (Angular 9→15 upgrade) with token overlap score 0.29 → relationship: <b>related</b> → action: <b>extend_existing</b></div>"]:::header

    %% ── Legend ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
